# Copy to .env.local (untracked) and fill in as needed.

# Extra hostnames allowed to reach `astro dev`, comma-separated.
# Vite blocks unknown Host headers, so a VPN/tunnel domain must be listed here
# to load the dev server by name. A leading dot matches all subdomains.
# Bare IP addresses always work and don't need an entry.
# DEV_ALLOWED_HOSTS=.example.ts.net
